# The intimate steps of the romance page, moved word for word out of RomanceLines.cs and the
# spicy answers of Conversation.Unified.cs (criterion F7 of koikatsu-decisao-criterios-falas-fixas). Same situations as
# romance.dlg (on romance, on me.romance) and the same weights (@weights romance); Conversation.Romance.cs fills the keys.
# {act} feelings | tease | whisper | memories | private | sneak | bold | heldback | wary (what you did),
# {q} how she took it: yes | no, wary for a wary yes to sneaking off, maybe for a bold line she neither took nor refused,
# lead for the flustered beat before a wary yes, no_spicy for a wary no to a spicy line, and for heldback what held her
# back (Consent.HeldBack: personality | mood | guilt | girlfriend | soon | asked | grudge | neglected | name | other),
# {close} Lines.Closeness (2 = together), {lvl} intimate (feelings: your girlfriend, lewdness 70+), gf | notgf (whisper,
# bold), first | again (memories: her H count), moment (private: a real moment, not the H).
# {hook} the line you just said: each line of yours has one (tease.kiss, whisper.uniform,
# memories.again, sneak.private; the teasing about something here and now in Conversation.Unified.cs sets tease.sleepy,
# tease.stomach, tease.looking, tease.swimsuit, tease.gym, tease.library, tease.rooftop, tease.cute). An answer that quotes
# you or answers one line only has "hook=" for it; the plain rules fit every line of the step. Teasing has no plain
# answer: every one of them belongs to a line of yours.

# ================= how she feels about you, intimate =================
@rule romance.feelings.intimate.gentle
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=intimate tone=gentle
feel shy
- You're my boyfriend... and the only one who gets to see me like... that. Don't make me say more!
- You're my boyfriend... and only you see me like... that. Don't make me say more!
- You're the only one I'd ever... um... you know.
- You're mine, and I'm yours... in every way. Ah, embarrassing!

@rule romance.feelings.intimate.energetic
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=intimate tone=energetic
feel shy
- You're my favorite person! And, um... I kinda can't stop thinking about you. In every way. Ehehe...
- You're my favorite! And I think about you ALL the ways! Ehehe!
- You're mine! Heart, body, everything! Too much?
- I can't stop thinking about you! Like, at all! In every way!

@rule romance.feelings.intimate.cool
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=intimate tone=cool
feel shy
- You're mine. All of you. That's what I think.
- You're mine. Entirely.
- All of you belongs to me.
- You're mine. Body included.

@rule romance.feelings.intimate.teasing
on romance
when act=feelings q=yes lvl=intimate tone=teasing
feel shy
- You're my boyfriend and my favorite toy. Is that honest enough for you?
- My boyfriend and my favorite plaything. Honest enough?
- Mine to love and mine to tease.
- You're my boyfriend. And my toy. Both.

# ================= teasing =================
@rule me.romance.tease.close.kiss
on me.romance
when act=tease close>=2
hook tease.kiss
- You know what you look like right now? Very kissable.

@rule me.romance.tease.close.skirt
on me.romance
when act=tease close>=2
hook tease.skirt
- That skirt's a little short today. Not that I'm complaining.

@rule me.romance.tease.close.hot
on me.romance
when act=tease close>=2
hook tease.hot
- Is it hot in here, or is it just you?

@rule me.romance.tease.far.stare
on me.romance
when act=tease close<=1
hook tease.stare
- You've been staring at me, haven't you?

@rule me.romance.tease.far.ideas
on me.romance
when act=tease close<=1
hook tease.ideas
- Careful, if you keep smiling like that I'll get ideas.

@rule me.romance.tease.far.looks
on me.romance
when act=tease close<=1
hook tease.looks
- You look really good today. Like, distractingly good.

